# Applies to builds whose context is software/, which is the hwio-raspberry
# image: it needs hwio-raspberry/ and stm32/proto/cybics.proto and nothing else.
#
# Without this the context carries software/rpi-image/, which holds the pi-gen
# checkout and the built SD card images once anyone has run a local image build.
# That is tens of gigabytes sent to the daemon for a container that copies three
# files.

# pi-gen checkout and built images
rpi-image/

# Submodules and vendored trees no image with this context copies
OpenPLC/
FUXA/

# Zephyr build output
stm32/build/

.git/
.gitignore
.devcontainer/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
